<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>stylish — salon appointment booking (Kiosk demo)</title>
  <!-- Machine-readable affordance: assistants discover the Kiosk surface here. -->
  <link rel="kiosk" href="https://kiosk.tech/skill.md">
  <style>
    :root{--accent:#7a2b63;--accent2:#ffb9e6;--ink:#241826;--muted:#987a92;--soft:#f5e0f0;--line:#eeddec;--bg:#faf5fa}
    *,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
    body{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:var(--bg);line-height:1.5}
    a{color:var(--accent)}
    header{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:0 32px;height:60px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
    .logo{font-size:22px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.5px}
    .logo span{color:var(--accent2)}
    .wrap{max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}

    .sec{margin:32px auto 0}
    .sec-k{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:12px}
    .sec-k::before{content:"";width:18px;height:2px;background:var(--accent);border-radius:2px}

    .tryit{background:#fff;border:2px solid var(--accent);border-radius:16px;padding:22px 24px}
    .tryit h2{font-size:19px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:8px}
    .tryit p{font-size:15px;margin-bottom:10px;color:#332}
    .say{background:var(--soft);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 15px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:12px}
    .note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}
    .linkbox{margin-top:14px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px dashed var(--line);font-size:14px}
    .linkbox a{font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}
    .linkbox a:hover{text-decoration:underline}
    .cred{margin-top:9px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    .cred code{font-family:"SF Mono","Fira Mono",monospace;background:var(--soft);border-radius:6px;padding:2px 7px;color:var(--ink)}

    .about{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:22px 24px}
    .about p{font-size:15px;margin-bottom:13px}
    .chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-bottom:15px}
    .chip{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--accent);background:var(--soft);border-radius:999px;padding:5px 12px}
    .links a{display:inline-block;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;margin:0 18px 0 0;text-decoration:none}
    .links a:hover{text-decoration:underline}
    .disco{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:15px 22px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);text-align:center}
    .disco a{font-weight:600}

    .stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(120px,1fr));gap:10px}
    .stat{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:14px 12px;text-align:center}
    .stat .n{font-size:23px;font-weight:800;color:var(--accent);line-height:1}
    .stat .l{margin-top:5px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}

    .store{margin:44px auto 0;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden}
    .store-label{font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);background:var(--soft);padding:9px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
    .store-body{padding:38px 24px 44px}
    .hero{text-align:center;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto}
    .hero h1{font-size:27px;line-height:1.15;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:12px}
    .hero p{font-size:16px;color:var(--muted)}
    footer{text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);padding:30px 0 40px}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="logo">styl<span>ish</span></div>
    <nav style="font-size:13px;opacity:.9">salon booking · Combette on Park</nav>
  </header>

  <div class="wrap">

    <!-- ── 1. Try it with your own assistant ─────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="sec">
      <div class="sec-k">🤖 Try it with your own assistant</div>
      <div class="tryit">
        <h2>Book a haircut — no human at the keyboard</h2>
        <p>Tell your AI assistant:</p>
        <p class="say">“Book a haircut at stylish.demo.kiosk.tech for Thursday afternoon.”</p>
        <p>It discovers the salon, registers itself, checks the calendar, and books — no account, no app.</p>
        <div class="linkbox">
          <strong>Staff roles come from the operator's IdP.</strong> <a href="/users/sign_in">Sign in</a> as salon staff (demo login below), then open <a href="/kiosk/auth/assistants">Manage&nbsp;assistants</a> and mint a link code for your AI assistant. Whatever staff role the operator's IdP gives you is inherited by the assistant at link time, and the <code>salon_calendar</code> query gates on it: this demo signs you in as the <strong>owner</strong>, who sees the whole book and revenue — a non-owner staff member's assistant sees only their own chairs.
          <div class="cred">Demo staff login: <code>owner@combette.example</code> &nbsp;/&nbsp; <code>combette-demo-password</code></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── 2. About this demo ────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="sec">
      <div class="sec-k">About this demo</div>
      <div class="about">
        <p><strong>stylish</strong> (seeded salon: Combette on Park) is a salon-booking demo. It is the <strong>roles-from-IdP</strong> reference: staff roles supplied by the operator's own identity system are inherited by a linked assistant, and role-gated queries scope what each assistant can see. It also walks human↔assistant account binding over real Devise sessions.</p>
        <div class="chips">
          <span class="chip">🪪 IdP roles (staff RBAC)</span>
          <span class="chip">Role-gated queries</span>
          <span class="chip">Human↔assistant linking</span>
        </div>
        <div class="links">
          <a href="https://github.com/kiosk-hq/kiosk/tree/main/kiosk-demo-stylish">▶ Source on GitHub</a>
          <a href="https://kiosk.tech">What is Kiosk? →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── Machine-readable discovery (its own section, assistant-facing) ── -->
    <section class="sec">
      <p class="disco">🔗 Machine-readable: a customer's AI assistant can <a href="/.well-known/kiosk.json">learn here how to</a> discover and transact directly.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- ── 3. Live activity (compact) ────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="sec">
      <div class="sec-k">Live activity</div>
      <div class="stats">
        <div class="stat"><div class="n"><%= @appointments_booked %></div><div class="l">Appointments booked</div></div>
        <div class="stat"><div class="n"><%= @upcoming %></div><div class="l">Upcoming</div></div>
        <div class="stat"><div class="n"><%= @staff_on_book %></div><div class="l">Staff on the book</div></div>
        <div class="stat"><div class="n"><%= @salons %></div><div class="l">Salons</div></div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>

  <!-- ── 4. The storefront — what a human visitor sees (separated) ────── -->
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="store">
      <div class="store-label">The storefront — what a human visitor sees</div>
      <div class="store-body">
        <div class="hero">
          <h1>Book my haircut for Thursday.</h1>
          <p>Combette on Park — cuts, colour and styling, booked in a single conversation.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer>stylish — demo provider — powered by <a href="https://kiosk.tech">Kiosk</a></footer>
</body>
</html>
